MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
  Original. Every note and every effect are synthesized in mix.py, _shared/audio/band.py, the scene-by-scene
  groove layer _shared/audio/groove.py (song mode, accompaniment under speech) and the cartoon effects of
  _shared/audio/toon.py (numpy/scipy), with the procedural helpers of core/audio/sfx.py. The song and score
  ("Snowy Sleigh Song", MUSIC.md and SOUND-PLAN.md) use the synthesized ukulele, xylophone, glockenspiel, celesta,
  harp, vibraphone, marimba, toy piano, pizzicato and spiccato strings, flute, clarinet, kazoo, accordion,
  trumpet, tuba, buzz bass and percussion voices, and the new sleigh bells (band.sleighbell, this episode).
  Waggle's "brr", the monarchs' wing flaps, Dot's yawn, the leaf "fwump" and the winter wind are synthesized in mix.py.
  No samples, loops or recordings by third parties.

